  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS<br>- Short walk to the beach <br>- Event Friendly<br>- Low-Speed Vehicle<br>- Extended Heated Private Pool **Pool heating available Oct 1-May 1 for $35 per day**<br>- Game room<br>- Private balconies with scenic views<br>- Nearby dining and shopping<br>- 13 adult bikes <br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - ALL linens, including comforter covers, are laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: For Shore, a luxurious home in the exclusive Blue Mountain Beach community, is 6 minutes from the beach with Emerald Coast views. Spanning over 5,000 square feet, this spacious retreat sleeps up to 30 guests with 13 beautifully-appointed bedrooms and 10.5 bathrooms. Ideal for retreats, weddings, and other special events, For Shore offers a luxurious setting with a lovely pool and outdoor area for unforgettable gatherings.<br><br>This 4-story coastal haven features a spacious outdoor entertainment area with a pristine green turf backyard—a versatile space that can be easily rearranged to suit any event. Barbeque on the natural gas grill, dine alfresco at the 6-person table, watch the kids splash in the pool, or sunbathe on the 4 loungers. Retire to the first-floor guest bedroom with a king bed and private bathroom—or hang out in the climate-controlled garage that doubles as a game room with a billiards table, foosball table, and TV. Beyond the laundry room with 3 washer and dryers, the in-home elevator takes guests to any of the four floors.<br><br>The main floor is the heart of the home—soft sunlight illuminates the spacious great room. A grandiose table seats 30 guests and turns any dinner party into an unforgettable celebration. The kitchen was designed for large parties, offering abundant cabinetry, counter space, and high-end appliances, including 2 refrigerators and 2 microwaves. The living area has 2 spacious sectionals and an impressive 86\" TV, and the theater room's 75\" TV and 7-person couch are great for casual lounging and movie nights.<br><br>The third floor, designated for sleeping, features a primary bedroom with a king bed, private bathroom, and balcony access, alongside a bunk room with a full-over-full bed and 4 guest bedrooms—2 of these bedrooms have private bathrooms, 3 have king beds, and the last has a queen bed.<br><br>The fourth-floor bedrooms mirror the third-floor layout, boasting a primary bedroom, 4 guest bedrooms, and a bunk room. All bedrooms throughout the home have TVs.<br><br>For Shore is the ultimate paradise for large gatherings along the Emerald Coast and offers on-site parking for 6 vehicles, 13 adult bikes, and a 6-passenger golf cart. Book this unforgettable home today!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS: (SLEEPS 30):<br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Handicap Accessible Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bathroom: Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: Full/Full Bunk Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>FOURTH FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: Full/Full Bunk Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>*This home can accommodate corporate retreats/meetings, family reunions, weddings, and other events.<br><br>*This home is pet-friendly with an additional, non-refundable pet fee of $400, plus tax. Limit of 2 dogs max.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
